Abstract = {As a. starting point to the environmental adaptability theory, this
   paper elaborates the concept of adaptation and promotes the open,
   long-effective and combinable design method. Based on this, the
   experimental disaster environmental adaptable device has been invented.
   Also, by regarding the theory of building adjustment as a theoretical
   framework, the present study seeks to discover the applicability of
   environmentally adaptive model which can meet the need after the
   emergency or disasters, playing an essential part to the
   self-regeneration, and in addition to find other adaptative models which
