   Kaifeng, PEOPLES R CHINA, AUG 19-21, 2010},
Organization = {Int Soc Resource Environm Informat Technol},
Abstract = {Subsidence lands in mining area are important land resources and real
   estate properties whose utilization should be scientifically planned and
   rationally redistributed. Taking ArcGIS Engine as developing components
   and Visual C + + as developing tools, this paper develops and realizes
   the application of inverse distance weighted interpolation method in
   research on subsidence area. By applying IDW interpolation method which
   handles influencing factors of subsidence area, the authors determine
   the incidence of subsidence area and potential subsidence area and
   further point out a new approach for research on subsidence land of
   mining area.},
