Note = {International Conference on Sustainable Energy and Environment
   Protection (ICSEEP), Guangzhou, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 30-31, 2015},
Abstract = {Wenyuan building is one of the most historic and significant buildings
   in Tongji University. It has an asymmetric designed, reinforced concrete
   frame structure. It is three stories and consists of a typical layout
   and simple shape. It is an excellent, local building that was designed
   with the influence of modernist style. It is the first modernist and
   Bauhaus style of architecture in China. The first enclosed,
   energy-saving laboratory was created in the Wenyuan building in 2012.
   The lab uses many kinds of advanced, ecological, energy-saving
   technologies, and utilizes monitoring equipment of energy consumption
   that provides real-time surveillance of the energy consumption.
   Collecting this real-time data, the lab can specify the quantifiable
   purpose of each ecological energy-saving effect. This paper respectively
   introduces several main ecological energy-saving technologies.},
