   2011},
Organization = {Tianjin Univ Commerce},
Abstract = {In recent years, with the rapid urbanism implementing economic
   transformation is imminent for the resource-based cities. In this paper,
   based on brief analysis of the urbanization, sustainable urbanization
   and economic transition. Based on practical investigations and
   collecting in formations, the thesis analyses the necessity of economy
   transformation in Shanxi. Then, this paper points out the problems of
   the Shanxi economy development: Extensive farming and management;
   Imbalance in regional development; The low utilization of resources;
   Safe accidents. Finally combining with the actual situation of Shanxi,
   this paper proposes some countermeasures and suggestions: Regulating
   industrial structure; Balance urban and rural development; Expanding
   green economy, circular economy and low-carbon economy; Learn each
   other's experience.},
