Abstract = {It is undoubted that low-carbon city has become a vital development
   trend for Chinese cities in the new century. Many Chinese cities have
   been devoted to the upsurge of low-carbon city construction in recent
   years. Focusing on these problems - What measures has been adopted to
   construct low-carbon city in China? How is the effect of low-carbon city
   construction? Are there some issues needing attention in the future -
   this paper summarizes the situation of low-carbon city development in
   China and clarifies a few viewpoints that need be paid attention to in
   the subsequent development. It is expected that the discussion in this
